		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4285&amp;p=32358#p32358"><![CDATA[
The tabs are intentional. <br><br>It forces the spreadsheet program to interpret the field as a string of characters and not try to convert it to a number. <br><br>When importing back into the CPS the tab is optional. All fields are treated as strings when importing. Tabs are ignored. <br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Wed Jul 31, 2024 11:36 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
